cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FastSLR in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FastSLR: Universal Deterministic Triage for Systematic Literature Reviews"
abstract: >-
  FastSLR is a deterministic CLI/TUI tool for the screening (triage) stage of
  Systematic Literature Reviews. Given a corpus of articles and a configurable
  set of weighted search terms, it produces reproducible APPROVED/FLAGGED/REJECTED
  decisions with full auditability and academic export packages.
type: software
version: 3.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-10
